195
00:08:53,362 --> 00:08:56,850
一个非常典型的入场点示例
a really neat example in terms of entry points,

196
00:08:56,850 --> 00:08:58,788
也是一个典型的信号点示例
in terms of signal points.

197
00:08:59,110 --> 00:09:00,775
关于目标位，同样
In terms of targets, again,

198
00:09:00,775 --> 00:09:03,772
我不喜欢花太多时间
I don’t like to spend too much time

199
00:09:03,772 --> 00:09:06,769
思考目标位，因为这是个人化的选择
mulling over targets because it’s a personal thing.

201
00:09:06,850 --> 00:09:09,381
我何时出场，你何时出场
Where I get out, where you get out,

202
00:09:09,381 --> 00:09:10,646
所有人何时出场
where everyone gets out,

203
00:09:10,646 --> 00:09:14,126
都取决于我们最终想要达成的目标
it all depends on what we’re ultimately trying to achieve.

204
00:09:15,431 --> 00:09:17,712
市场会进入价格发现模式
they do go into price discovery mode,

205
00:09:17,712 --> 00:09:24,229
这意味着，根据定义，市场会比你预想的走得更远一点，好的
which means, by that very definition, the market should go a little bit further than what you might think. Okay,

207
00:09:24,410 --> 00:09:27,450
