the breakout is purely dependent on where the liquidity is provided.

209
00:09:27,770 --> 00:09:31,366
所以如果有人愿意提供流动性，市场就会停止；如果没有
So if someone’s willing to provide liquidity, the market will stop. If they’re not,

211
00:09:32,490 --> 00:09:39,050
直到找到所需的流动性。这就是我们突破策略训练的总结
until it finds the desired liquidity. That's a wrap-up of our drill session on the breakout strategy.

